==English==

===Etymology===
Based on {{etyl|frm|en}} {{m|fr|judicieux}}, itself ultimately derived from {{etyl|la|en}} {{m|la|iudico}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|UK}} {{IPA|/dʒuˈdɪʃ.əs/|lang=en}}
* {{rhymes|ɪʃəs|lang=en}}

